### 1. Server salomatligini tekshirish
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health

### 2. Ro'yxatdan o'tish (Register)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ali Valiyev",
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Tizimga kirish (Login)
# Response headerda HttpOnly kuki (refreshToken) keladi
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Himoyalangan endpointga so'rov (Get Me)
# <ACCESS_TOKEN> o'rniga login orqali olingan tokenni qo'ying
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### 5. Access tokenni yangilash (Silent Refresh)
# Brauzer yoki REST Client avtomatik tarzda Cookie: refreshToken=<token> ni yuboradi
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/refresh

### 6. Tizimdan chiqish (Logout)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/logout

